So here's the scoop, <name>. One of our agents has found an entrance to the portal world where Sargeras is keeping his personal felhound. We can't strike at him directly, but he's imbued a lot of power into this creature.
 That's the good news.

 The bad news, however, is outright gruesome. He's been feeding this monster on the brains of our allies, and that's all it will eat. As horrifying as it is, there's a fresh supply of corpses at the Broken Shore. Head down and get them. 
